  "notes": "GRAMMAR: Functions as a noun and as a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb ({体験|たいけん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {体験|たいけん}{談|だん} (personal account, firsthand story)\n- {体験|たいけん}⟦{学習|がくしゅう}→学習：02623_gakushuu⟧ (experiential learning)\n- {体験|たいけん}⟦{入学|にゅうがく}→入学：02092_nyuugaku⟧ (trial enrollment)\n- ⟦{無料|むりょう}→無料：01662_muryou⟧{体験|たいけん} (free trial)\n- {体験|たいけん}⟦レッスン→レッスン：01542_ressun⟧ (trial lesson)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS: ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧ also means \"experience\" but is broader and more general. {体験|たいけん} emphasizes direct, firsthand, often one-time personal involvement, while ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧ includes accumulated knowledge and skill from past events.",
